NOTICES

- Fonts: This repository distributes no font files. The tool modifies fonts
  already installed on the user's own Mac (e.g. Apple SD Gothic Neo) locally
  and installs the result into the user's own font directory. The original
  fonts remain subject to their own licenses; this project grants no rights to
  them and does not redistribute them or any derivative of them.

- "Consolas" is a trademark of Microsoft Corporation. This project does not
  distribute Microsoft's Consolas font. It only generates, locally, a font
  that reuses the name "Consolas" so that applications whose code-font stack
  begins with Consolas pick it up. No affiliation with or endorsement by
  Microsoft is implied.

- Logo: docs/logo.png was generated with Google Gemini.
